    "Start first playback through an explicit user click. Handle onAutoplayBlocked and show a user-gesture retry. Use playsinline:1 and allow autoplay on the iframe.",
    "Advance the local recommendation queue on the ENDED player state, using the same visible player. Keep consent and the continuous-play toggle explicit. Avoid calling playback merely to increase views.",
